 \par
Tiedragon maintains this legacy version of Syscalculator.\par
\par
This is planned as the final Syscalculator 1.x legacy release before the new Syscalculator 2.0 line, built with modern technology. Syscalculator 2.0 is already in development to reduce the risks of relying on the outdated VB6 runtime. Version 2.0 will bring new features that the old 1.7x line does not have. It should be a big surprise.\par
\par
This version is FREEWARE.\par
\par
