\par
What's new in 1.74 RC1?\par
\par
Release note: After 20 years, Syscalculator 1.74 is finally released. This last 1.74 legacy version adds the newer euro countries, including recent euro adoptions such as Croatia 2023 and Bulgaria 2026, and fixes startup/configuration problems that kept Syscalculator from working properly on Windows 7 and later. We tested this 1.74 release on Windows 11; after the fixes it appears to work okay. Oops.\par
\par
-Updated legacy branding to Tiedragon.\par
-Added the newer euro adopters: Slovenia (SIT), Cyprus (CYP), Malta (MTL), Slovakia (SKK), Estonia (EEK), Latvia (LVL), Lithuania (LTL), Croatia (HRK, euro adoption 2023) and Bulgaria (BGN, euro adoption 2026).\par
-Added a modern Inno Setup installer for Syscalculator 1.74.\par
-Fixed first-run configuration fallback so the installed converter catalog and language files are found on Windows 7 and later.\par
-Installer language selection now starts Syscalculator with the matching language file.\par
-Documented that WizardExpress works best with older Office/Word versions, LibreOffice has been tested and works ok, and Microsoft 365 / Office 365 is not reliable with this old VB6 integration.\par
\par
